    thinking: "**Updating the Interface**\n\nI\'m currently working on redesigning the Researcher page. The goal is a more cohesive look, so I\'m integrating Material Design principles by swapping out plain Tailwind classes for the variables defined in `globals.css`\342\200\224`bg-surface-container-lowest`, `text-on-surface`, and `bg-primary` are going to be key. I\'m also planning some `framer-motion` animations to add some life to it.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
