    thinking: "**Summarizing Final Steps**\n\nThe application compiles, which is great. I\'m now reviewing the recent developments, focusing on the correct configuration to work seamlessly within the AI Studio environment. Specifically, the configuration in package.json and next.config.ts was adapted to allow the application to compile correctly. Plus, the UI system has been upgraded to be cohesive. The next stage is drafting a final summary for the user.\n\n\n"
