    thinking: "**Confirming Successful Integration**\n\nIt\'s all working smoothly now, completely integrated with Firebase for all user roles. The Admin Portal\'s been updated to pull real-time data and allow status modification. The Researcher Portal is also connected to Firebase.\n\n\n"
